# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# All real proxying happens in Pages Functions under functions/api/ — external
# 200-rewrites in this file are unreliable on Cloudflare and can't set the
# request headers ESPN and Reddit require. The routes are:
#
#   /api/espn-core/*  → sports.core.api.espn.com   (season leaders, $ref lookups)
#   /api/espn-site/*  → site.api.espn.com          (scoreboard, news, rankings)
#   /api/espn-web/*   → site.web.api.espn.com      (standings, byathlete)
#   /api/cfb-odds     → The Odds API (key held server-side)
#   /api/cfb-teams    → slimmed FBS directory + conference standings
#   /api/reddit-fn    → r/CFB hot posts
#   /api/diag         → deployment diagnostics
#
# The line below is only a soft fallback for desktop browsers where a direct
# Reddit call happens to work.

/api/reddit/*     https://www.reddit.com/:splat            200
